<title>UK: Rheinboden sets 200 mln mark step-up callable bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden sets 200 mln mark step-up callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Sal-Oppenheim and GZB Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY   *05.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*STEPS-UP TO 4.75 PCT ON 05.FEB.98 IF NOT CALLED AT</p>
<p>		 PAR.</p>
<p>		 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
